return ['domain'=>'zinn-cache','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'zinn-cache','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:36:54+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:36:54+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Cache'=>'Zinn® Cache','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache','For sites hosted with Zinn Digital®. Controls the page cache your Zinn® server already provides — smart auto-purge on content change, remote purge from your Zinn® dashboard, a Redis object-cache toggle, safe WordPress/WooCommerce exclusions, and one-click admin login. This is a cache controller, not a cache engine. Hosting elsewhere? Install Zinn® Cache Engine instead.'=>'Kwa tovuti zinazopangishwa na Zinn Digital®. Inadhibiti kashe ya ukurasa ambayo seva yako ya Zinn® tayari inatoa — kusafisha kiotomatiki kwa akili wakati maudhui yanabadilika, kusafisha kwa mbali kutoka kwenye dashibodi yako ya Zinn®, kitufe cha kuwasha/kuzima cha Redis object-cache, kutengwa salama kwa WordPress/WooCommerce, na kuingia kwa msimamizi kwa mbofyo mmoja. Hiki ni kidhibiti cha kashe, si injini ya kashe. Unapangisha kwingine? Sakinisha Zinn® Cache Engine badala yake.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Cache'=>'Akiba ya muda','Page cache'=>'Kache ya ukurasa','Object cache'=>'Akiba ya vitu','Purging'=>'Inafuta','Exclusions'=>'Vizuvi','Purge everything now'=>'Safisha kila kitu sasa','Every cached page is discarded and will be rebuilt as visitors arrive. Continue?'=>'Kila ukurasa uliowekwa kwenye akiba unafutwa na utajengwa upya kadiri wageni wanavyowili. Unataka kuendelea?','Full-page cache'=>'Kache ya ukurasa mzima','Served by LiteSpeed at the web server, before WordPress runs. This is where nearly all the speed comes from.'=>'Inahudumiwa na LiteSpeed kwenye seva ya wavuti, kabla ya WordPress haijaanza kufanya kazi. Hapa ndipo kasi yote inapotoka.','Send LiteSpeed cache-control and tag headers on cacheable pages'=>'Tuma vichwa vya habari vya cache-control na tag vya LiteSpeed kwenye kurasa zinazoweza kuwekwa kwenye kache','How long a page stays cached'=>'Muda ambao ukurasa unakaa kwenye kache','Seconds. A week suits most sites; a news site publishing hourly wants far less.'=>'Sekunde. Wiki moja inafaa tovuti nyingi; tovuti ya habari inayochapisha kila saa inahitaji muda mfupi zaidi.','How long a visitor’s browser keeps images and scripts'=>'Muda ambao kivinjari cha mgeni huweka picha na hati tumizi','Seconds. Applies to images, CSS and JavaScript only — never to pages. Set to 0 to leave this to your host.'=>'Sekunde. Inahusu picha, CSS na JavaScript pekee — haihusu kurasa kamwe. Weka 0 ili kuiachia mwenyeji wako.','Signed-in visitors'=>'Wagenzi walioingia kwenye mfumo','Never serve a cached page to a signed-in visitor'=>'Kamwe usimhudumie mgeni aliyeingia kwenye akaunti yake ukurasa uliowekwa kwenye kache','On is the safe answer and the default. Turn it off only if you know every cached page is identical for every signed-in user — a membership site is the usual reason not to.'=>'On ndiyo jibu salama na chaguo-msingi. Izimie tu ikiwa unajua kwamba kila kurasa iliyohifadhiwa kwenye kashia ni sawa kwa kila mtumiaji aliyeingia — tovuti ya uanachama ndiyo sababu ya kawaida ya kutofanya hivyo.','Different lifetimes for different content'=>'Muda tofauti wa maisha kwa maudhui tofauti','For example: a shop’s product pages for an hour, while everything else stays a week.'=>'Kwa mfano: kurasa za bidhaa za duka kwa saa moja, wakati kila kitu kingine kinakaa wiki moja.','Add a rule'=>'Ongeza sheria','Content type'=>'Aina ya maudhui','Seconds'=>'Sekunde','Object cache (Redis)'=>'Akiba ya vitu (Redis)','Caches the results of database queries. It helps most on a busy shop or a site with a lot of signed-in traffic, where the page cache cannot.'=>'Huweka akiba matokeo ya hoja za hifadhidata. Inasaidia zaidi kwenye duka lenye shughuli nyingi au tovuti yenye trafiki kubwa ya walioingia kwenye akaunti, ambapo akiba ya kurasa haiwezi kusaidia.','Install the Redis object-cache drop-in'=>'Sakinisha kijenzi cha kache ya vitu cha Redis','Needs the phpredis extension. If it is missing, the box above this screen says so.'=>'Inahitaji kiendelezi cha phpredis. Ikiwa haipo, sanduku lililo juu ya skrini hii linaeleza hivyo.','Redis host'=>'Mwenyeji wa Redis','Redis port'=>'Mlango wa Redis','Redis database'=>'Hifadhidata ya Redis','Give each site on a shared Redis its own number, or they will clear each other’s cache.'=>'Mpe kila tovuti kwenye Redis inayoshirikiwa nambari yake yenyewe, la sivyo zitafuta kashi za kila moja.','Redis password'=>'Nenosiri la Redis','Leave blank if your Redis does not need one.'=>'Acha wazi ikiwa Redis yako haihitaji moja.','Key prefix'=>'Kiambishi awali cha kitufe','An alternative to a separate database number when you cannot have one.'=>'Njia mbadala ya nambari tofauti ya hifadhidata wakati huwezi kuwa nayo.','Smart auto-purge'=>'Usafishaji-otomatiki wa akili','Clear affected pages automatically when content changes'=>'Futa kiotomatiki kurasa zilizoathiriwa wakati maudhui yanabadilika','After updates'=>'Baada ya sasisho','Clear everything after a core, plugin or theme update'=>'Futa kila kitu baada ya sasisho la mfumo mkuu, programu-jalizi au mandhari','After a comment'=>'Baada ya maoni','Clear a post’s page when a comment on it is approved'=>'Futa ukurasa wa chapisho wakati maoni juu yake yameidhinishwa','Turn this off on a very busy comment section, where it can clear the same page hundreds of times an hour.'=>'Zima hii kwenye sehemu ya maoni yenye shughuli nyingi, ambapo inaweza kufuta ukurasa huo huo mamia ya mara kwa saa.','Never cache these'=>'Usihifadhi kamwe kwenye akiba haya','Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied — cart, checkout, my-account and any signed-in session are never cached, whatever is below.'=>'Viwango maalum vya WordPress na WooCommerce vinatumika kila wakati—kikapu, malipo, akaunti yangu na kipindi chochote kilichoingia havihifadhiwa kwenye kache kamwe, chochote kilicho hapa chini.','Addresses'=>'Anwani','One path per line, for example <code>/basket</code>. A trailing <code>*</code> matches everything under it.'=>'Njia moja kwa kila mstari, kwa mfano <code>/basket</code>. <code>*</code> inayofuata mwishoni inalingana na kila kitu kilicho chini yake.','Query parameters'=>'Vigezo vya ulizo','A page carrying one of these is never cached — for example a one-time preview token.'=>'Ukurasa wenye mojawapo ya haya hauhifadhiwi kamwe kwenye kache — kwa mfano, ishara ya hakiki ya mara moja tu.','Cookies'=>'Vidakuzi','A visitor carrying one of these is always served a fresh page.'=>'Mgeni anayebeba moja ya hizi daima hutumiwa ukurasa mpya.','Every cached page has been discarded. They will be rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'Kila ukurasa uliowekwa kwenye akiba umefutwa. Zitajengwa upya kadiri wageni wanavyofika.','The page cache is on, but this server is not LiteSpeed.'=>'Kache ya ukurasa imewashwa, lakini seva hii si LiteSpeed.','The cache headers are being sent and nothing is reading them, so pages are not actually being cached. Ask your host whether LiteSpeed is available, or move to Zinn® hosting where it is standard.'=>'Vichwa vya habari vya akiba vinatumwa na hakuna kinachovisoma, kwa hivyo kurasa hazihifadhiwa kwa akiba kweli. Uliza mwenyeji wako kama LiteSpeed inapatikana, au hamia kwenye eneo-kazi la Zinn® ambapo ni kiwango.','The object cache is on, but this server has no Redis support.'=>'Akiba ya vitu imewashwa, lakini seva hii haina usaidizi wa Redis.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so the drop-in cannot be used and WordPress is falling back to its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'Upanuzi wa phpredis haujasakinishwa, kwa hivyo programu jalizi ya kuangusha haitumiki na WordPress inarejelea akiba yake ya kumbukumbu ya ndani. Mwombe mwenyeji wako kuwezesha phpredis.','Nothing is being cached.'=>'Hakuna kinachowekwa kwenye akiba.','Both caches are switched off, so this plugin is not making the site any faster.'=>'Kache zote mbili zimezimwa, kwa hivyo programu jalizi hii haifanyi tovuti iwe ya kasi zaidi.','Caching is active on this site.'=>'Uhifadhi wa akiba umewashwa kwenye tovuti hii.','Web server'=>'Seva ya mtandao','LiteSpeed — page caching available'=>'LiteSpeed — uhifadhi wa kache wa kurasa unapatikana','not LiteSpeed — page caching unavailable'=>'siyo LiteSpeed — akiba ya ukurasa haipatikani','Redis support'=>'Usaidizi wa Redis','phpredis is installed'=>'phpredis imewekwa','phpredis is not installed'=>'phpredis haijasakinishwa','Page lifetime'=>'Muda wa kuishi wa ukurasa','You are not allowed to purge the cache.'=>'Huna ruhusa ya kusafisha akiba.','Cache purge requested.'=>'Ombi la kusafisha akiba limewasilishwa.','Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin.'=>'Zinn® Cache: kache nyingine ya vitu imewekwa, kwa hivyo kache ya vitu ya Redis haisimamiwi na programu-jalizi hii.','detected'=>'kimegunduliwa','not detected'=>'hakijagunduliwa','phpredis extension missing'=>'kiendelezi cha phpredis hakipo','active'=>'amilifu','inactive'=>'haifanyi kazi','LiteSpeed cache:'=>'Akiba ya LiteSpeed:','Redis object cache:'=>'Akiba ya vitu ya Redis:','The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled.'=>'Kiendelezi cha PHP cha Redis (phpredis) hakipatikani kwenye seva hii, kwa hivyo akiba ya vitu haiwezi kuwezeshwa.','Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache.'=>'Kipengele kingine cha kushusha cha kache ya vitu kimesakinishwa tayari. Kiondoe kabla ya kuwezesha kache ya vitu ya Zinn®.','Could not write the Redis connection configuration file.'=>'Haikuweza kuandika faili ya usanidi wa muunganisho wa Redis.','The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read.'=>'Kiendeshi cha akiba ya vitu kilichoambatanishwa hakikuweza kusomwa.','Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content.'=>'Haikuweza kusakinisha kiendeshi cha akiba ya vitu ndani ya wp-content.','Could not remove the object-cache drop-in.'=>'Haikuweza kuondoa kiendeshi cha akiba ya vitu.','The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed.'=>'Mfumo wa faili wa WordPress hauwezi kuandikwa, kwa hivyo kiendeshi cha akiba ya vitu hakikuweza kusimamiwa.','This one-click login link is not valid any more. Links expire after a couple of minutes and can only be used once — open your site from the Zinn® dashboard again to get a fresh one.'=>'Kiungo hiki cha kuingia kwa mbofyo mmoja hakifai tena. Viungo huisha muda wake baada ya dakika kadhaa na vinaweza kutumika mara moja tu — fungua tovuti yako kutoka kwenye dashibodi ya Zinn® tena ili kupata kipya.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Tazama maelezo ya toleo la Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sasisho lililopakuliwa lilishindwa ukaguzi wake wa uadilifu na halikusakinishwa.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Imetunza. Andika thamani mpya ili kuichukua nafasi.','Filter this list…'=>'Chuja orodha hii...','Filter this list'=>'Chuja orodha hii','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Hakuna kinacholingana na kichungi hicho.','Add a row'=>'Ongeza safu','Remove this row'=>'Ondoa safu hii','Remove'=>'Odoa','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — muhtasari','Overview'=>'Muhtasari','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Kila programu jalizi ya Zinn® kwenye tovuti hii, na kama inafanya kazi.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Hakuna muunganisho unaohitajika kwa programu-jalizi hii.','Open settings'=>'Fungua mipangilio','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Huna ruhusa ya kubadilisha mipangilio hii.','Settings sections'=>'Sehemu za mipangilio','Support'=>'Usaidizi','Save changes'=>'Hifadhi mabadiliko','Tools'=>'Zana','Export settings'=>'Hamisha mipangilio','Reset to defaults'=>'Rudisha kwa chaguo-msingi','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Hii inarejesha kila mpangilio kwenye programu-jalizi hii katika hali yake ya awali. Uendelee?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Uchunguzi wa usaidizi','Import a settings file'=>'Ingiza faili la mipangilio','Import'=>'Ingiza','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Faili zilizosafirishwa haziwezi kuwa na nywila, ishara au funguo za API — utahitaji kuingiza tena kwenye tovuti mpya.','Settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio imehifadhiwa.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Kila mpangilio kwenye programu-jalizi hii umerudi kwenye hali yake chaguomsingi.','Done.'=>'Imekamilika.','That action is not available.'=>'Kitendo hicho hakipatikani.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Faili hiyo haikuweza kusomwa. Chochagua faili ya mipangilio iliyosafirishwa kutoka kwa programu jalizi ya Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Faili hiyo ni kubwa mno kuwa usafirishaji wa mipangilio.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Faili hilo si usafirishaji wa mipangilio ya Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Faili hiyo ilisafirishwa kutoka kwa programu-jalizi nyingine (%s), kwa hivyo kuileta hapa kutahifadhi mipangoni ambayo programu-jalizi hii haielewi.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'Mpangilio %d umeingizwa. Nywila na funguo za API haziwahi kuwepo kwenye usafirishaji, kwa hivyo ziingize tena.' . "\0" . 'Mipangilio %d imeletwa. Nywila na funguo za API hazipo kwenye usafirishaji kamwe, kwa hivyo weka hizo tena.','Connected'=>'Imeunganishwa','Connecting…'=>'Inaunganisha…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Imeunganishwa, lakini kuna jambo linahitaji uangalifu','Not connected'=>'Haijaunganishwa','Running on your own account'=>'Inayoendeshwa kwenye akaunti yako mwenyewe','We could not check this'=>'Hatukuweza kuangalia hili','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Plugin hii haikusema sababu. Tuma ripoti ya uchunguzi na tutaiangalia.','Connection status'=>'Hali ya muunganisho','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Iliwekwa mwisho kuangaliwa %s zilizopita.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(inafungua kwenye kichupo kipya)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma hii kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Hiki ndicho kitakachotumwa hasa — hakuna kingine, wala chochote kilichofichwa. Nywila zako, tokeni na funguo za API hazimo ndani yake.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Ripoti ya uchunguzi itakayotumwa','Copy to clipboard'=>'Nakili kwenye ubao klipu','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma ripoti hii kwa msaada wa Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Tunakufungulia tiketi ya usaidizi na kukujibu kupitia barua pepe. Ikiwa unapendelea kutoituma, ikili nakala hapo juu na ubandike kwenye tiketi wewe mwenyewe.','Copied'=>'Imenakopwa','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Hatukuweza kufika Zinn Digital® kutoka kwa seva hii (%s). Nakili ripoti iliyo hapo juu na ufungue tikiti badala yake — hakuna chochote kuhusu mipangilio yako kilicho kibaya.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn® umepokea ripoti yako na utajibu kupitia barua pepe.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn® una ripoti yako — rejeleo %s — na utajibu kwa barua pepe.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Umetuma ripoti kadhaa kwa muda mfupi. Subiri dakika chache na ujaribu tena — zile za awali ziliwasili.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuweza kupokea ripoti hiyo kwa sasa — hilo ni tatizo letu, si lako. Jaribu tena hivi karibuni, au nakili ripoti iliyo hapo juu kwenye tiketi.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Ripoti imekataliwa (HTTP %d). Iiga hapo juu na ufungue tikiti, ukitaja nambari hiyo.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — miongozo na huduma','User guides'=>'Miongozo ya watumiaji','Read the %s user guide'=>'Soma mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa %s','Hide this'=>'Ficha hii','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Utoaji wa Zinn® kwa ajili ya WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamiaji wa bure na kidhibiti kilichoundwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha zaidi ya tovuti moja.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Soko la Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Nunua na uuze tovuti, vikoa na nafasi za viungo zilizowekwa tayari, huku pesa zikiwekwa kwa usalama hadi pande zote mbili zitakapofurahi.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ajiri watu wanaofanya kazi hii kwa ajili ya riziki','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Soko letu la kimataifa la wafanyakazi huru: vinjari huduma zaidi ya 10,000 zilizotengenezwa tayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, watengenezaji na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi na uwaruhusu watoe zabuni.','Style preset'=>'Kielelezo cha mtindo kilichowekwa mapema','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Sehemu ya kuanzia. Chochote kilicho hapa chini kinabatilisha hili.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Tumia rangi na saizi zangu mwenyewe','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Acha hili lisiwe limewashwa na kielelezo kilichowekwa awali kitatumika jinsi kilivyo.']];